{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "31a18751018707475c197b961aecccfefd641c0b4f1d905ac493fa2413a7908d", "ja": "せっかくだし、可愛いボタンに替えてみよう！\nどんなボタンが合うかな～♪", "zh": "难得有这个机会，换成可爱的按钮试试看吧！\n什么样的按钮合适呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "744910ba46112309ba75fc18729c8b1066a3563d9a684f5868dc58c016841d68", "ja": "青羽さん、お疲れさまです。\nなんだか嬉しそうですね？", "zh": "青羽小姐，辛苦了。\n看起来心情很好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "01e4a9886dc7a513311ce6c2bb7233a2d9621e6b1741c3170cc8b564cbcab5c0", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです！\n実は……帰りに手芸屋さんに寄ろうと思ってるんです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了！\n其实……我打算回去的时候顺路去趟手工艺品店。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "0044220219207c5473425704e951ded8f72fc97c588c3f93c34cca377347ab00", "ja": "新しい生地やボタンに出会えるといいなぁって。\nお洋服の事を考えると、ワクワクしちゃって。えへへ♪", "zh": "希望能遇上新的布料和纽扣呢。\n一想到衣服的事情，就忍不住兴奋起来。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "9ee2a9306ab9ad4f3c96c1aa2664878dda7278fd904e75bae28472e6f232a3d2", "ja": "いいですね！\nちょっとした生活の潤いって感じですね。", "zh": "挺好的啊！\n感觉就像是给生活增添了一点小情趣呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "269935c775fe65f800ff848804f3ecd984c0dfe8f7dcd0f585d928f58e1beea9", "ja": "潤い……。そっか。豪華なホテルも素敵だけど、\nこういうことでもいいんだ……。", "zh": "“滋润……原来如此。豪华酒店虽然也很棒，\n但这种事情也可以啊……”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "0b491de023a141cb79952afd32edb89b6e04e1bfbb20cce18285eb484659f7ff", "ja": "青羽さん？　どうかしましたか？", "zh": "青羽小姐？怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "9c08ec1a2ff7aa285cc2e1b0e0957c1545a0e79e1b2a922af11a5dcf76366c3f", "ja": "な、なんでもないです！　えへへ～♪\nあっ、そういえば！　社長さんがお呼びでしたよ？", "zh": "没、没什么！嘿嘿～♪\n啊，对了！社长叫您过去哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "f67017046cc7487a0eba94d47447f8fcf2e208ab7cf2fd7da7398db5f4c5f3c3", "ja": "社長が？　何か用事かな？\nありがとうございます。早速、行ってみますね！", "zh": "社长找我？不知道有什么事。\n谢谢告知。我这就去看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "d9051dda6495ae7e11c280b72a6238b891b0630511f34e7097d4d4434c19bc9c", "ja": "はーい。気をつけて行ってらっしゃーい♪", "zh": "好——路上小心，慢走哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_intro_1010_null", "source_sha256": "a643276fac463f5e06ddf29dab1f31b8e2c7f7bb284470f7983baf09f788ee39", "ja": "そして……。", "zh": "接着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_intro_1011_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "4817ef484f095f2d025e06cb85b678b99110d9c709c139c062720ccaae7dfebd", "ja": "社長、音無さん、お疲れ様です！\nお呼びだと聞いたのですが……。", "zh": "社长、音无女士，辛苦了！\n听说您找我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_intro_1013_101kot", "source_sha256": "8680bebdcaac07efaa725cd3c675bdf969f272ab7cb80f3dab7016d6de3e160b", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れ様です♪\n今、温かいお茶淹れてきますね。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了♪\n我这就去泡热茶过来哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "de574e575ac762e98e691845c7275fa94d26732f176698c17adedaab9150cac3", "ja": "おお君、来てくれたか！　いやいや、ご苦労。\n今日は君に、嬉しい知らせがあってね。", "zh": "哦，你来了啊！辛苦你了。\n今天有个好消息要告诉你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "41018859c4bb865b4b609eda4fd975608f6656be3577f64bb5873ad474316f2a", "ja": "他でもない。君に手掛けてもらったユニット、\n『4 Luxury』のことなんだが……。", "zh": "不是别的，正是由你负责打造的组合——\n“4 Luxury”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_intro_1016_p", "source_sha256": "fc2a4fb726410e97a0b85907b94b8f352b9a7d2bc9571cb52486aed346d7861e", "ja": "ああ、このみさんと麗花、それに歌織さん、風花の\n4人ユニットですね。ドラマも盛況でした。", "zh": "啊，就是由木下小姐、丽花、歌织小姐，还有风花组成的4人组合吧。她们的电视剧也大受欢迎。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "e5555c08c0ca1f6f701189ddee74e0b4ce0f6995d8d7f683f137c00c3197bbab", "ja": "そう、実はその『4 Luxury』に、\nテレビ局からオファーが来たんだよ！", "zh": "对了，其实电视台向那部《4 Luxury》发来邀约了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_intro_1018_p", "source_sha256": "8819d5be9dbf517967de450c2cfeda21116089a1a4b2a029b68416e9ebb11f99", "ja": "おお、それは嬉しいお話ですね！　……あれ？\nでもドラマの放送から随分経ってますけど……。", "zh": "哦，那可真是个令人高兴的消息！……咦？\n不过，电视剧播出已经过去很久了吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_intro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "6cdb74b0a4ab569147e241a17c3f1e2bcf55586d5113f91fd1e55a453a6ad4f6", "ja": "なんでも、放送が終わった今でも、\nドラマの再放送を望む声が多いらしい。", "zh": "听说即使现在节目已经播完了，仍然有很多人希望重播这部剧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "1d5bfbfbb88ce6e0ff037fc9e3641045af0f4c86a416b413a6fd1c65a6fa56d6", "ja": "彼女達の根強い人気に目をつけたテレビ局から、\n特別番組をやってみないかと持ちかけてきたんだ。", "zh": "电视台看中了她们扎实的人气，\n提议要不要做一期特别节目。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_intro_1021_p", "source_sha256": "61fada2900032d96d30aaaaa9af0a959a7afc00ad164758a865b8572af88a1c2", "ja": "それはいいですね。\n特別番組と聞いたら、アイドル達も喜びます。", "zh": "这不是挺好的吗。听说要做特别节目，偶像们也会很高兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_intro_1022_101kot", "source_sha256": "d3130e0c646f7ecf0f50ca7e86fa37bf38ac342a0840564bd409deeeb4a2302c", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お茶どうぞ♪\nその番組って、先程言ってたゴージャスなお話ですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，请用茶♪\n那个节目，就是刚才说的很豪华的那件事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_intro_1023_p", "source_sha256": "6e65867a12b462ddd5732fba07f7b9ab7e257220fc0ceb738aa9ce8ddbd51669", "ja": "え？　ゴージャス？", "zh": "咦？豪华？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "ad99c2e7fce3d8175712a2f8cbd3fba6c7eebccd7b91af43ac91d4776909a34a", "ja": "ああ。オトナ女子が憧れるゴージャスな番組にしたい\nということらしくてね。", "zh": "啊。听说她想做成成熟女性憧憬的华丽节目。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "b2ba86a1a721e33c0197a9dd98c9eb0886f0450c77a6ec6a8aa2f5280097b16b", "ja": "ついては、劇場の方でも、\n何かできないかと考えてみたわけだが……。", "zh": "于是，剧场这边也考虑了一下能不能做些什么……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_intro_1026_p", "source_sha256": "de43290024545c1a267dd5cb3c22680090748f93e4d4da7d32fa849526373050", "ja": "劇場で……なるほど！\nここで『4 Luxury』リバイバル公演の出番ですね！", "zh": "剧场这边……原来如此！这里正好可以安排“4 Luxury”复出演出！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_intro_1027_president", "source_sha256": "0abdc2b27d8a0ec9b94367a938a2678ce59a6cba1aed6f85b99d0277b36775c1", "ja": "その通り！　私が尋ねる前に答えを返すとは、\nさすがは君だ！", "zh": "没错！居然在我提问之前就给出了答案，不愧是你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_intro_1028_101kot", "source_sha256": "64dd55180128af7723edb7ce6048d0ba9e91dcd2cdc3dfdc7bd9db9578f34647", "ja": "そういえば、{$P$}さん。\n『RED ZONE』の動画の再生回数、みましたか？", "zh": "对了，{$P$}先生。\n您看过《RED ZONE》视频的播放次数吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_intro_1029_p", "source_sha256": "36c5b0c11a305470e685c28305e856432ecc42c33650423939d85e94b7d604da", "ja": "いえ、最近はあまり確認できてないですけど……\nわっ！　いつの間にこんな数に？", "zh": "还没，最近没怎么去看过呢……\n哇！什么时候涨到这种播放量了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_intro_1030_101kot", "source_sha256": "b2bd45d2e265ed7597dc4b802ffb89e51e3fa975d350e885fe1cde97034cc8e1", "ja": "曲も歌詞も歌ってるみんなの姿もカッコいいって、\nオトナ女子の間で人気らしいですよ。ふふっ。", "zh": "听说在成熟女性之间很受欢迎呢，说是曲子、歌词还有大家演唱时的姿态都很帅气。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_intro_1031_101kot", "source_sha256": "5b4cea190ac8a1c5ce79f2c266a2f45e8a07065664bae7b9f90d5082bfdc439c", "ja": "みんなの公演があるって知ったら、\n動画で知った人達も来てくれるかもしれませんね！", "zh": "要是知道大家有公演，\n通过视频了解她们的人说不定也会过来呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_intro_1032_president", "source_sha256": "0913b5490d9b5fdc9dc44ba67b1bde497f885a08fe18dd7cef14f4dc48c86ac9", "ja": "おお、いいじゃないか！\nそれじゃ、オファーの返事は私からしておくとして。", "zh": "哦，不错嘛！\n那么，邀请的回复就由我来回吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_intro_1033_president", "source_sha256": "bdb9d06fce68a4cb96fa976247f5eb8c150e2192f9d2a2c3f1590be5c7440a4d", "ja": "君は、番組出演の進行と合わせて、\nリバイバル公演の準備も進めてくれたまえ。", "zh": "你就一边推进节目的出演事宜，\n一边筹备重制演出吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_intro_1034_p", "source_sha256": "554474fd0bcf2bfe062fc8966c856638d191d6e42e5346541d56a279e7d8ced6", "ja": "はい、わかりました！", "zh": "好，我明白了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_intro_1035_p", "source_sha256": "5df6ffa1eceb7a6267fd0a22170e31439d39bf0be53c34cee642e90488fadfc2", "ja": "（特別番組の出演に、リバイバル公演の決定……\n4人の魅力をもっと見てもらえるように頑張ろう！）", "zh": "（特别节目的出演、复兴公演的确定……为了让更多人看到4人的魅力，一起努力吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
